X:6
T:Amazing Grace
C:Words: John Newton (1779); tune: New Britain (USA, 1829)
O:USA
R:hymn
M:3/4
L:1/4
K:G
N:A Christian hymn: follow your school's guidance on religious songs. Newton had been a slave-ship captain before he became a clergyman and, later, an abolitionist; that history is often taught with it.
